{"4789190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AerOS Sight: Digital Bubble Edition", "steam_appid": 4789190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Open your eyes to a new Sight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789190/extras/1af03679e83d1e194de3740f34b8d7d0.avif?t=1785365913\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789190/extras_big/1af03679e83d1e194de3740f34b8d7d0.webp?t=1785365913 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AerOS Sight</i> is the newest, fastest, and cleanest addition to our Operating System line. A brand-new design is waiting for you, along with countless new improvements over its predecessor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now available in its digital format, the <i>AerOS Sight: Digital Bubble Edition</i> delivers an even faster experience than its physical counterpart, <span class=\"bb_strike\">which will no longer be available or supported</span>. Enjoy an exclusive <span class=\"bb_strike\">and permanent</span> experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">“It’s like a game, designed to be enjoyed, not only used” - Starfruti’s CEO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789190/extras/8684015c97b6879eb99fd222a2100e11.avif?t=1785365913\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789190/extras_big/8684015c97b6879eb99fd222a2100e11.webp?t=1785365913 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office assistants are a thing of the past! Meet your new personal helpers: the <i>Miniature Sentinel Jellies</i> (MSJs for short). Each one is fully self-aware, with its own unique personality and style. Access them through our new software, Fruti Place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will help protect your personal computer against unauthorized access<span class=\"bb_strike\">, except during Starfruti’s authorized system takeovers resulting from violations of the Terms of Service</span>, fighting against any threat across different areas of your computer, facing enemies that threaten the beauty and integrity of your system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you completely rid your PC of the invaders?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789190/extras/633a4e5d374df4b9e634167ed49b0196.avif?t=1785365913\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789190/extras_big/633a4e5d374df4b9e634167ed49b0196.webp?t=1785365913 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Since they are fully customizable, different modifications can make them even stronger and more efficient. With each wave, they will grow more powerful, but expect the same from your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruti Place isn't the only thing you can interact with on your system. Use other tabs and complete tasks while your MSJs handle the hard work. By doing so, you'll earn new modifications for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789190/extras/181ca65ec2f5de5c50943e2e4af5ae58.avif?t=1785365913\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app